<title>USA: DSC Communications in pact with LCI.</title>
<headline>DSC Communications in pact with LCI.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSC Communications Corp said Tuesday it has signed an agreement with LCI International Inc to deliver DSC's Intelligent Networking systems.</p>
<p>LCI, a long-distance carrier based in McLean, Va., selected multiple elements from DSC's INfusion product family to help it offer new services to LCI customers, DSC said.</p>
<p>Product deliveries are scheduled to take place in mid-1997, the telecommunication products company said.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
